title: Defend both what is and what is not your job.
pid: 68f6ccf2-cef5-416d-bdf4-1749bd9ec2f7
body: |2-
  If you see someone doing work you are more suited to,
  make it known.
  If you feel yourself working too hard at something
  that another specialist would be better for,
  make it known -- whether they exist or not.
